    "markdown": "---\nname: Spotify - Web Player: Music for everyone\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#b3b3b3\"\n  background: \"#121212\"\n  text: \"#b3b3b3\"\ntypography:\n  heading-1:\n    fontFamily: SpotifyMixUI\n    fontFamilyStack: \"SpotifyMixUI, CircularSp-Arab, CircularSp-Hebr, CircularSp-Cyrl, CircularSp-Grek, CircularSp-Deva, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", helvetica, arial, \\\"Hiragino Sans\\\", \\\"Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN\\\", Meiryo, \\\"MS Gothic\\\"\"\n    fontSize: 16px\n    fontWeight: 700\n  heading-2:\n    fontFamily: SpotifyMixUI\n    fontFamilyStack: \"SpotifyMixUI, CircularSp-Arab, CircularSp-Hebr, CircularSp-Cyrl, CircularSp-Grek, CircularSp-Deva, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", helvetica, arial, \\\"Hiragino Sans\\\", \\\"Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN\\\", Meiryo, \\\"MS Gothic\\\"\"\n    fontSize: 24px\n    fontWeight: 700\n  heading-3:\n    fontFamily: SpotifyMixUI\n    fontFamilyStack: \"SpotifyMixUI, CircularSp-Arab, CircularSp-Hebr, CircularSp-Cyrl, CircularSp-Grek, CircularSp-Deva, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", helvetica, arial, \\\"Hiragino Sans\\\", \\\"Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN\\\", Meiryo, \\\"MS Gothic\\\"\"\n    fontSize: 16px\n    fontWeight: 700\n  body:\n    fontFamily: SpotifyMixUI\n    fontFamilyStack: \"SpotifyMixUI, CircularSp-Arab, CircularSp-Hebr, CircularSp-Cyrl, CircularSp-Grek, CircularSp-Deva, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", helvetica, arial, \\\"Hiragino Sans\\\", \\\"Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN\\\", Meiryo, \\\"MS Gothic\\\"\"\n    fontWeight: 400\nrounded:\n  md: 9999px\n  button: 9999px\n  card: 8px\n  pill: 9999px\nspacing:\n  scale: [\"4px\", \"8px\", \"12px\", \"16px\", \"24px\", \"153.719px\"]\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"#1f1f1f\"\n    color: \"#b3b3b3\"\n    radius: 8px\n    padding: \"16px 20px\"\n  link:\n    color: \"#ffffff\"\n    textDecoration: none\n    fontWeight: 700\n  headings:\n    h1:\n      lineHeight: normal\n      letterSpacing: normal\n      color: \"#ffffff\"\n    h2:\n      lineHeight: normal\n      letterSpacing: normal\n      color: \"#ffffff\"\n    h3:\n      lineHeight: normal\n      letterSpacing: normal\n      color: \"#ffffff\"\n---\n\n## Overview\n\nDesign system \"Spotify - Web Player: Music for everyone\".\n\n## Colors\n\n- **Primary** — `{colors.primary}` — `#b3b3b3`\n- **Background** — `{colors.background}` — `#121212`\n- **Text** — `{colors.text}` — `#b3b3b3`\n\n## Typography\n\n- **Headings** — `SpotifyMixUI`, weight `700`. Sizes: h1 16px / h2 24px / h3 16px.\n- **Body** — `SpotifyMixUI`, weight `400`.\n\n## Shapes\n\n- Border radius: `9999px`\n\n## Spacing\n\n- Scale: `4px / 8px / 12px / 16px / 24px / 153.719px`\n\n## Components\n\n### Card\n\n- Background — `{components.card.background}` — `#1f1f1f`\n- Color — `#b3b3b3`\n- Radius — `8px`\n- Padding — `16px 20px`\n\n### Link\n\n- Color — `{components.link.color}` — `#ffffff`\n- Decoration — `none`\n- Weight — `700`\n\n### Headings\n\n- **h1** — line-height `normal`, letter-spacing `normal`, color `#ffffff`.\n- **h2** — line-height `normal`, letter-spacing `normal`, color `#ffffff`.\n- **h3** — line-height `normal`, letter-spacing `normal`, color `#ffffff`.\n",
